Package: iron-base-files
Architecture: all
Depends: base-files,
         python3,
         dconf-cli,
         ca-certificates,
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: systemd-zram-generator, ubuntu-drivers-common, unattended-upgrades, friendly-recovery
Description: Iron Linux Ingot base system identity and policy
 OS identity (os-release, lsb-release, issue), APT policy (no snapd, Mozilla's
 signed Firefox repository), zram swap, sysctl defaults, GRUB defaults,
 adaptive hardware profile (iron-hwprofile), driver management (iron-drivers)
 and recovery-mode options.

Package: iron-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: plymouth-theme-spinner, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Iron Linux Ingot artwork
 Original Ingot wallpapers, logo, wordmark and the Plymouth boot splash.

Package: iron-shell
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 49), gnome-shell (<< 51),
         gnome-shell-ubuntu-extensions,
         yaru-theme-gnome-shell,
         iron-branding (= ${source:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Iron Linux Ingot GNOME Shell experience
 First-party GNOME Shell extensions maintained with the OS:
  - Iron Tiling: two/three-column and 2x2/3x3 grid layouts, drag-to-snap,
    keyboard layout selection, gaps, per-workspace and multi-monitor layouts,
    resizable tiles with persistent ratios.
  - Iron Shell: panel identity, lock-screen styling and the Agent Desktops
    indicator.
 Also provides the Ingot login-screen (GDM) theme.

Package: iron-desktop-settings
